## Baseline

This repo follows the [ocx-sh/conventions](https://github.com/ocx-sh/conventions) baseline, rendered by copier (`.copier-answers.yml`).
Template-owned files (`taskfiles/baseline.taskfile.yml`, `.pre-commit-config.yaml`, `cliff.toml`, `renovate.json`, `CLAUDE.md`, `.github/workflows/verify-*.yml`{% if profile == 'full' and bazel %}, `bazel/baseline.bazelrc`{% endif %}, ...) must never be hand-edited: change ocx-sh/conventions, then run `ocx exec -- task copier:update`. `task baseline:check` fails on drift.
